The testnet checkpoints are the ones of the public testnet, a private testnet
does not have those blocks. monero-lws refuses to follow a chain that does not
match them ("Attempting rollback past last checkpoint"), and it cannot be told
to ignore them on testnet. Only the genesis is kept.

diff --git a/src/checkpoints/checkpoints.cpp b/src/checkpoints/checkpoints.cpp
